edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186411254 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186411267 #edb/ref 1069 "q-34163" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186411267 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186411267 #edb/ref 1071 "If $b=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]$ and $c=[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$, then $b\\cdot c=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186411267 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "535d2613-b3a1-5204-b804-20416fe47ef7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186411267 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute the dot product, we add up the products of corresponding components:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b\\cdot c & ={b}_{1}\\cdot {c}_{1}+{b}_{2}\\cdot {c}_{2}+{b}_{3}\\cdot {c}_{3}+{b}_{4}\\cdot {c}_{4} \\\\  & =(-3)\\cdot (-4)+2\\cdot (-2)+1\\cdot 3+4\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =12-4+3+4 \\\\  & =15\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186411268 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186411255 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186411268 #edb/ref 1069 "q-73940" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186411268 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186411268 #edb/ref 1071 "Let $v=[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$ and $w=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].$ What is $(-3v)\\cdot w?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186411268 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "5a2c3118-2e96-5ebd-b1cc-e7d3498c7926" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186411268 #edb/ref 1074 "First, multiplying each component of $v$ by $-3$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3v & =-3[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}12 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 9 \\\\ -3 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}]\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo compute the dot product, we add up the products of corresponding components:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-3v)\\cdot w & =12\\cdot 1+(-6)\\cdot 4+9\\cdot 1+(-3)\\cdot 2+(-3)\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =12-24+9-6-6 \\\\  & =-15\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186411269 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 175