 17592186045417] [17592186411272 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "f20a436e-0127-5928-a01b-2889e7a8ec0e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186411272 #edb/ref 1074 "Multiplying each component of $r$ by $\\frac{2}{3},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{3}r & =\\frac{2}{3}[\\begin{aligned}-9 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot (-9) \\\\ \\frac{2}{3}\\cdot 1 \\\\ \\frac{2}{3}\\cdot 0 \\\\ \\frac{2}{3}\\cdot 3 \\\\ \\frac{2}{3}\\cdot (-1)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-6 \\\\ \\frac{2}{3} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -\\frac{2}{3}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
